sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FeedbackGW as Feedback Gateway
    participant ReportCtrl as Report Controller
    participant SessionRepo as Session Repository
    participant ScoreRepo as Score Repository
    participant ReportRepo as Report Repository (PostgreSQL)
    participant ReportSvc as Report Service
    participant TurnRepo as Turn Repository
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository
    participant MetricRepo as Metric Repository
    participant DocStoreSvc as Document Store Service (MongoDB)
    participant PDFLib as PDF Library (Puppeteer/PDFKit)
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO

    User->>FeedbackGW: POST /reports/generate<br/>{sessionId, format: "pdf" | "json"}
    FeedbackGW->>ReportCtrl: Forward request

    ReportCtrl->>SessionRepo: Validate session exists
    ReportCtrl->>ScoreRepo: Validate scorecard exists
    alt No scorecard
        ScoreRepo-->>ReportCtrl: Not found
        ReportCtrl-->>User: 404 Scorecard Not Found
    end

    ReportCtrl->>ReportRepo: Create ReportRequest<br/>{sessionId, format, status: "queued"}
    ReportRepo-->>ReportCtrl: Request created {reportRequestId}

    ReportCtrl-->>User: 200 OK (async)<br/>{reportRequestId}

    Note over ReportSvc: Background processing starts

    ReportSvc->>SessionRepo: Retrieve session metadata
    SessionRepo-->>ReportSvc: Session data

    ReportSvc->>TurnRepo: Retrieve all turns
    TurnRepo-->>ReportSvc: Turn history

    ReportSvc->>ScoreRepo: Retrieve scorecard + items + tips
    ScoreRepo-->>ReportSvc: Complete scorecard

    alt Transcript available
        ReportSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Retrieve transcript
        TranscriptRepo-->>ReportSvc: Transcript data
    end

    ReportSvc->>MetricRepo: Retrieve metrics
    MetricRepo-->>ReportSvc: Usage & performance metrics

    Note over ReportSvc: Assemble report content:<br/>- Executive summary<br/>- Conversation transcript<br/>- Scoring breakdown<br/>- Coaching recommendations<br/>- Performance charts

    alt format = "pdf"
        ReportSvc->>PDFLib: Render PDF<br/>(with branding & formatting)
        PDFLib-->>ReportSvc: PDF binary

        ReportSvc->>StorageSvc: Upload PDF to S3
        StorageSvc->>S3: Store file
        S3-->>StorageSvc: Storage key
        StorageSvc-->>ReportSvc: MediaAsset created {assetId}

        ReportSvc->>ReportRepo: Update ReportRequest<br/>{status: "ready", assetId, signedURL}
    else format = "json"
        ReportSvc->>DocStoreSvc: Create ReportSnapshot<br/>{_id: reportRequestId, structured data}
        DocStoreSvc-->>ReportSvc: Document created

        ReportSvc->>ReportRepo: Update ReportRequest<br/>{status: "ready"}
    end

    Note over User: User polls status

    User->>FeedbackGW: GET /reports/{reportRequestId}
    FeedbackGW->>ReportCtrl: Check status
    ReportCtrl->>ReportRepo: Retrieve ReportRequest
    ReportRepo-->>ReportCtrl: Status & format

    alt format = "pdf"
        ReportCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{status: "ready", downloadUrl}
    else format = "json"
        ReportCtrl->>DocStoreSvc: Retrieve ReportSnapshot
        DocStoreSvc-->>ReportCtrl: Report data
        ReportCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{status: "ready", data: {...}}
    end